# spinofin default Flatpaks -- GUI apps installed on first boot.
# INI format: one [Flatpak Preinstall <app-id>] group per app.
# https://docs.flatpak.org/en/latest/flatpak-command-reference.html#flatpak-preinstall
#
# Entries below are split into two groups:
#   1. Bluefin defaults -- the full set installed on a fresh ublue-os/bluefin
#      system, confirmed via `flatpak list --system --app` on a live install
#      (2026-07). Declared here so a fresh spinofin ISO install gets the same
#      baseline as a rebase from an existing Bluefin system (rebases keep
#      these because /var/lib/flatpak persists across an image swap; a
#      from-scratch ISO install does not unless this image declares them
#      itself).
#   2. spinofin additions -- our own apps, appended below, that aren't
#      already covered by the Bluefin defaults above.

### --- Bluefin defaults (verified via `flatpak list --system` on a fresh install) ---

[Flatpak Preinstall com.github.PintaProject.Pinta]
Branch=stable

[Flatpak Preinstall io.github.kolunmi.Bazaar]
Branch=stable

[Flatpak Preinstall com.github.tchx84.Flatseal]
Branch=stable

